%% Community Event Management System - Architecture Diagram
flowchart TD
    Browser[Browser]
    Views[Bootstrap Razor Views]
    Controllers[MVC Controllers]
    ServiceInterfaces[Service Interfaces]
    Services[Service Implementations]
    Strategies[Strategy Filters]
    Repository[Generic Repository]
    DbContext[ApplicationDbContext]
    Database[(SQL Server LocalDB)]
    Identity[ASP.NET Core Identity]
    Migrations[EF Core Migrations]
    Tests[xUnit Tests]

    Browser --> Views
    Views --> Controllers
    Controllers -->|depend on abstractions| ServiceInterfaces
    ServiceInterfaces --> Services
    Services --> Repository
    Services --> Strategies
    Repository --> DbContext
    DbContext --> Database
    DbContext --> Identity
    Migrations --> Database

    Tests -->|unit test service layer| Services
    Tests -->|InMemory provider| DbContext

    Controllers -. no direct DbContext usage .-> ServiceInterfaces
    Identity --> Controllers
